[00:00.0]On My Own - Ashes Remain
[00:11.340]Lyrics by：Benjamin Kirk/Jonathan Hively/Joshua Smith/Robert Tahan/Ryan Nalepa/Seth Mosley
[00:22.683]There's gotta be another way out
[00:25.262]I've been stuck in a cage with my doubt
[00:27.943]I've tried forever getting out on my own
[00:33.461]But every time I do this my way
[00:36.159]I get caught in the lies of the enemy
[00:38.815]I lay my troubles down I'm ready for you now
[00:43.394]Bring me out
[00:45.196]Come and find me in the dark now
[00:47.311]Everyday by myself I'm breaking down
[00:50.542]I don't wanna fight alone anymore
[00:54.560]Bring me out
[00:55.931]From the prison of my own pride
[00:58.257]My god I need a hope I can't deny
[01:01.56]In the end I'm realizing
[01:03.499]I was never meant to fight on my own
[01:12.67]Every little thing that I've known
[01:14.702]Is every thing I need to let go
[01:17.250]You're so much bigger than the world I've made
[01:22.579]So I surrender my soul
[01:25.326]I'm reaching out for your hope
[01:28.7]I lay my weapons down
[01:30.456]I'm ready for you now
[01:32.512]Bring me out
